  "body": "Maintainer request from #1452 (\"We should be able to load DXF file to do profile cuts on.\").\n\nDepends on #1864.\n\n## Goal\nLet `PlasmaProfile` cut DXF sketch chains and layers with per-chain Inside/Outside and direction overrides, inner-first order, and through-cut kerf verification.\n\n## Scope\n- Wire `OpParams::PlasmaProfile` (`crates/app/src/operation/plasma_op.rs`, `crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs`, lines 167-177) to resolve DXF sketch `ChainId` and `SketchLayer` picks with `part_solid = false` (no 3D part facets required).\n- Apply per-chain Inside/Outside side and CW/CCW direction overrides from #1864 when cutting closed inner holes and outer profiles, defaulting to plasma outer-vs-hole rules (`outer CW`, `inner CCW`) and cutting inner holes before outer contours.\n- Enforce open-chain safety cleanly: keep uncompensated centerline cuts working on open chains when selected cleanly, and refuse kerf-compensated (`Inside`/`Outside` or `G41`/`G42`) cuts on open chains by name.\n- Run kerf-crossing, small-hole feed/lead, rapid-height (`G30`), and fixture safety verification cleanly on sketch-only setups. (Provides shared 2D sketch profile cutting alongside `#1521` for plasma and future laser machines.)\n\n## Done means\n`PlasmaProfile` generates golden CL for DXF inner holes and outer profiles without a 3D mesh, respects per-chain overrides and inner-first cut ordering, refuses kerf compensation on open chains by name, and passes plasma post-gate verification tests.\n\nPart of #1452\n",
